    {
      "box": [
        118.76715774259372,
        205.5031729424879,
        421.9293898278213,
        244.02259942823147
      ],
      "text": "TRUE\nif the statement agrees with the information\nFALSE\nif the statement contradicts the information\nNOT GIVEN\nif there is no information on this\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        80.61770707376058,
        269.2055575498791,
        435.3085905159255,
        281.8146684537824
      ],
      "text": "1.\nOnleaving school, Moore did what his father wanted him to do.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        80.25780659575273,
        290.4396857523428,
        496.54743760653633,
        303.4090485995645
      ],
      "text": "2\nMoore began studying sculpture in his first term at the Leeds Schoo! of Art.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        80.25780659575273,
        312.0337144328144,
        493.4954885823359,
        324.6428253367177
      ],
      "text": "3.\nWhen Moore started at the Royal College of Art, its reputation for teaching\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        105.45084005630291,
        327.50943498715236,
        230.0843345861385,
        339.3980420044188
      ],
      "text": "sculpture was excellent.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        80.25780659575273,
        348.0237622336004,
        537.90734815463,
        360.27262119418526
      ],
      "text": "4\nMoore became aware of ancient sculpture as a result of visiting London museums.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        80.61770707376058,
        369.9776913920798,
        497.82155793484833,
        382.22655035266473
      ],
      "text": "5\nThe Trocadero Museum's Mayan sculpture attracted a lot of public interest.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        80.61770707376058,
        391.21181959454356,
        529.8454954386815,
        418.21551446874315
      ],
      "text": "6\nMoore thought the Mayan sculpture was similar in certain respects to other stone\nsculptures.\n"
    },
